        "text_ArXLLK": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>Rebel Nell's men's jewelry is made from repurposed graffiti, fragments of iconic landmarks, fan-favorite sports collaborations, and other one-of-a-kind sources, so nothing in the collection looks quite like anything else.</strong> That mix of substance and style is what makes our jewelry gifts for men feel right for the everyday guy, the sharp dresser, the sports fan, and the hard-to-shop-for.  Browse the rest of our <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/products\" title=\"shop all jewelry\">unique jewelry collection</a> for more reclaimed pieces with the same craft behind them.</p><p><strong>Rebel Nell was founded in Detroit in 2013 to put real craft and real meaning into every piece we make. </strong>Our Creative Designers, women employed through our workforce program, are the hands behind every piece, so each one carries the history of its material and a story of opportunity along with it. You can read <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-story\" title=\"read our story\">Rebel Nell's story</a> and read our <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/reviews-1\" title=\"read customer reviews\">customer reviews</a>. </p>"
